    "intro_html":  "Lemon-garlic-oregano chicken over rice with roasted zucchini, peppers, red onion, olives, cherry tomatoes, and a cool yogurt sauce. Each bowl runs \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at a lean {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). It is the Mediterranean fast-casual bowl, minus the $13 register total.",
